---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
---

<Base title="訂閱成功" description="電子報訂閱成功。" noindex>
  <div class="container thanks">
    <p class="eyebrow">電子報</p>
    <div class="gold-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <h1 class="thanks__title">收到了，謝謝你。</h1>
    <p class="thanks__text">
      信不常寄，所以每一封都值得等。哪天它出現在收件匣，希望你會想起撥接年代那一聲「<span lang="en" class="nowrap">You've got mail</span>」，心跳漏了半拍的那一瞬間。
    </p>
    <div class="thanks__action">
      <Button href="/" block>回首頁</Button>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .thanks {
    max-width: 560px;
    min-height: 70vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 22px;
    padding-block: 64px 96px;
  }

  .thanks .gold-rule {
    width: 44px;
  }

  .thanks__title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .thanks__text {
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
    letter-spacing: var(--ls-body);
    color: var(--color-body);
  }

  .nowrap {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .thanks__action {
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .thanks__action :global(.btn) {
    min-width: 240px;
  }
</style>
